        "description": "New Update is Here!\n\n🎉 Support Oktoberfest and unlock exclusive rewards\nHelp bring more attractions and features to life! With gems, you can access exclusive clothing items, like the diamond outfit. Your support directly helps us grow and improve the game!\n\n👒 New hats \nChoose from classic styles like the cowboy hat or builder’s helmet, festive sombreros and stocking caps, or quirky picks like the propeller cap, bunny ears, and adorable animal companions.\n\n🎮 Improved Player-to-Player Games\nConnecting with friends is easier than ever! Approach a player, click the dice icon near their nametag, and choose between “Clap It” or “Rock-Paper-Scissors.”\n\n🌟 Discord exclusive silver outfit\nChat, invite, and boost our server to earn XP. Reach Level 10 to unlock the stylish silver outfit and show your dedication!\n\nStep into the world of Oktoberfest, enjoy exciting new content, and help shape the future of the game! \n\nDon’t forget to join our Discord for exclusive perks https://discord.com/invite/bFVrUEM9Cq ",
